Here is the Fully Optimized version.
🚀 Key Optimizations Applied:
 * SXSSFWorkbook (Streaming Excel): Switched from XSSFWorkbook (Slow, Memory Heavy) to SXSSFWorkbook (Fast, Disk-backed). This drastically reduces the time to generate large Error files (from minutes to seconds).
 * Removed Synchronization: In a parallelStream, each row object is processed by only one thread at a time. The synchronized blocks were unnecessary and causing massive thread contention (waiting), slowing down processing. I removed them.
 * Aggregated Errors: I ensured every check (Branch, CGL, Currency, Product Code, Amount) runs independently so ALL errors are captured for a row, not just the first one.
